Client feedback analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness-program personalization"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer-service automation"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle tracking"},{"type":"h","text":"Business analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Client Data"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Assisted Pattern Identification"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Plan"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Consultation"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"AI should not independently diagnose or prescribe treatment."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness management"},{"type":"h","text":"Spa management"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitality management"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga"},{"type":"h","text":"Meditation"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"First aid/BLS"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health"},{"type":"h","text":"Business management"},{"type":"p","text":"For clinical Ayurveda practice, maintain the applicable professional registration and follow current regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BAMS graduate can consider relevant postgraduate pathways such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"MD Ayurveda"},{"type":"h","text":"MS Ayurveda"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospital Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare MBA"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga and wellness-related higher education"},{"type":"p","text":"For clinical specialization, pursue a recognized postgraduate Ayurveda program appropriate to the intended specialty."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other",